cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ngano, please cite it as below."
title: "ngano: a catalogue and unified loader for African-language speech datasets"
abstract: >-
  ngano is an open catalogue of 611 African-language speech datasets covering
  421 languages and 57 countries, with a public JSON API, an MCP server, and a
  single streaming loader API implemented in Python, JavaScript and Rust. Every
  figure is recorded as its publisher states it, self-reported sizes at or above
  20,000 hours are flagged and excluded from totals, and unstated fields are left
  null rather than estimated.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Misi
    given-names: Isheanesu Nigel
    alias: thisisisheanesu
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-01-01"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/thisisisheanesu/ngano/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/thisisisheanesu/ngano"
url: "https://ngano.dev"
keywords:
  - african languages
  - speech recognition
  - speech synthesis
  - low-resource languages
  - dataset catalogue
  - asr
  - tts
  - open data
